// The signing hook for tmuxedo for Mac (README.md, "Signing your own build").
//
// Out of the box the team is empty: build unsigned (CODE_SIGNING_ALLOWED=NO, what CI does and
// what `fastlane mac build` / `fastlane mac test` pass). To sign with your own Developer ID,
// create Signing.local.xcconfig next to this file (it is gitignored) with:
//
//   DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = <your 10-character Apple team id>
//
// then run `xcodegen generate` and `fastlane mac signed`. Notarising and distributing a build is
// up to whoever signs it.
DEVELOPMENT_TEAM =
#include? "Signing.local.xcconfig"
